---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Services & Operational Lanes"
  description="Explore Algoryxz's three operational lanes: Celebrations, Business & Brand, and Custom Systems, plus bounded recurring Care plans."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <header class="page-header">
        <span class="section-eyebrow">Studio Offerings</span>
        <h1 class="page-title">Services & Operational Lanes</h1>
        <p class="page-lead">
          We do not sell commodity page packs. We deliver scoped, high-craft digital assets across three specialized operational lanes, supported by disciplined Care plans.
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="services-stack">
        <!-- LANE 1: CELEBRATIONS -->
        <article id="celebrations" class="service-block">
          <div class="service-meta">
            <span class="service-index">LANE 01</span>
            <span class="badge badge-concept">Wedge Experience</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="service-title">Celebrations & Occasions</h2>
          <p class="service-summary">
            Emotion-first, highly visual, mobile-optimized portals for weddings, proposals, milestone anniversaries, and curated personal events.
          </p>
          <div class="service-details-grid">
            <div class="detail-box">
              <h3>What It Includes</h3>
              <ul>
                <li>Multi-day event schedule & interactive maps</li>
                <li>Per-event guest RSVP & dietary tracking</li>
                <li>Cloudflare R2 media gallery with zero egress fees</li>
                <li>WhatsApp card preview optimization</li>
                <li>Countdown timers & personalized greeting notes</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="detail-box">
              <h3>Turnaround & Delivery</h3>
              <p>Turnaround: <strong>3 to 7 business days</strong></p>
              <p>Revisions: <strong>2 consolidated rounds</strong></p>
              <p>Pricing floor: <strong>Starting from ₹2,500 – ₹15,000</strong> (Essential single-page to full wedding portal)</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- LANE 2: BUSINESS & BRAND -->
        <article id="business" class="service-block">
          <div class="service-meta">
            <span class="service-index">LANE 02</span>
            <span class="badge badge-concept">Commercial Engine</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="service-title">Business & Brand</h2>
          <p class="service-summary">
            Modern digital storefronts for cafés, salons, boutique gyms, clinics, creators, and local businesses. Built to turn visitors into paying customers.
          </p>
          <div class="service-details-grid">
            <div class="detail-box">
              <h3>What It Includes</h3>
              <ul>
                <li>Instant-loading menu & service catalog presentation</li>
                <li>One-tap phone calls & Google Maps direction routing</li>
                <li>Direct WhatsApp ordering/booking link generators</li>
                <li>Structured schema markup for local SEO rankings</li>
                <li>Sub-second Lighthouse performance scores (95+)</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="detail-box">
              <h3>Turnaround & Delivery</h3>
              <p>Turnaround: <strong>1 to 3 weeks</strong></p>
              <p>Revisions: <strong>2 consolidated rounds</strong></p>
              <p>Pricing floor: <strong>Starting from ₹5,000 – ₹35,000</strong> (Personal creator to full brand storefront)</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- LANE 3: CUSTOM SYSTEMS -->
        <article id="custom" class="service-block">
          <div class="service-meta">
            <span class="service-index">LANE 03</span>
            <span class="badge badge-concept">Advanced Architecture</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="service-title">Custom Systems</h2>
          <p class="service-summary">
            Bespoke web applications, custom booking engines, authenticated customer portals, and database-backed workflows tailored to unique business operations.
          </p>
          <div class="service-details-grid">
            <div class="detail-box">
              <h3>What It Includes</h3>
              <ul>
                <li>Multi-step custom scheduling & booking workflows</li>
                <li>Razorpay & UPI payment gateway integration</li>
                <li>Edge databases (Cloudflare D1 & Neon Postgres)</li>
                <li>Role-based access control & secure customer dashboards</li>
                <li>Automated transactional emails via Resend</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="detail-box">
              <h3>Turnaround & Delivery</h3>
              <p>Turnaround: <strong>3 to 8+ weeks</strong></p>
              <p>Contract structure: <strong>Milestone-governed payments only</strong></p>
              <p>Pricing floor: <strong>Starting floor ₹50,000+</strong> (Scored via 8-axis complexity engine)</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- CARE PLANS -->
        <article id="care" class="service-block care-block">
          <div class="service-meta">
            <span class="service-index">POST-LAUNCH</span>
            <span class="badge badge-client">Recurring Care</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="service-title">Care Plans & Maintenance</h2>
          <p class="service-summary">
            Bounded monthly support plans to keep your digital asset fast, secure, and maintained without open-ended retainer bloat.
          </p>
          <div class="care-plans-grid">
            <div class="care-plan-card">
              <h3>Care Lite</h3>
              <span class="care-price">₹499 / mo</span>
              <p class="care-target">For dormant weddings and static landing pages.</p>
              <ul class="care-features">
                <li>Cloudflare Pages hosting & SSL renewal</li>
                <li>Automated 3-min uptime monitoring</li>
                <li><strong>0 dev hours (Infra-only)</strong></li>
                <li>Zero rollover</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="care-plan-card care-plan-featured">
              <div class="popular-tag">Most Popular</div>
              <h3>Care</h3>
              <span class="care-price">₹999 / mo</span>
              <p class="care-target">For active cafés, salons, and local businesses.</p>
              <ul class="care-features">
                <li>All Care Lite infrastructure</li>
                <li><strong>Up to 30 mins/mo developer time</strong></li>
                <li>Menu price tweaks, hours, phone updates</li>
                <li>Monthly contact form health check</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="care-plan-card">
              <h3>Grow</h3>
              <span class="care-price">₹2,499 / mo</span>
              <p class="care-target">For growing brands and creator storefronts.</p>
              <ul class="care-features">
                <li>All Care infrastructure + 1-min monitoring</li>
                <li><strong>Up to 2 hours/mo developer time</strong></li>
                <li>Promotional banners & seasonal updates</li>
                <li>Quarterly SEO health review</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="services-cta">
        <h2>Unsure which lane fits your project?</h2>
        <p>Tell us what you want to achieve, and we’ll scope the exact solution.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Schedule a Discovery Call</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-header {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-16);
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  .section-eyebrow {
    display: block;
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    font-family: var(--font-family-mono);
    color: var(--color-accent-primary);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .page-title {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .page-lead {
    font-size: var(--font-size-lg);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  .services-stack {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-16);
  }

  .service-block {
    background-color: var(--color-bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-hairline);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: var(--space-8);
  }

  .service-meta {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .service-index {
    font-family: var(--font-family-mono);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .service-title {
    font-size: var(--font-size-3xl);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .service-summary {
    font-size: var(--font-size-lg);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-8);
    max-width: 760px;
  }

  .service-details-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-8);
    padding-top: var(--space-6);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-hairline);
  }

  .detail-box h3 {
    font-size: var(--font-size-base);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .detail-box ul {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2);
  }

  .detail-box li {
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-2);
  }

  .detail-box li::before {
    content: "•";
    color: var(--color-accent-primary);
  }

  .detail-box p {
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  /* Care Plans */
  .care-block {
    background-color: var(--color-bg-canvas);
    border-color: var(--color-border-subtle);
  }

  .care-plans-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-6);
    margin-top: var(--space-8);
  }

  .care-plan-card {
    background-color: var(--color-bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-hairline);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: var(--space-6);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    position: relative;
  }

  .care-plan-featured {
    border-color: var(--color-accent-primary);
  }

  .popular-tag {
    position: absolute;
    top: -10px;
    right: var(--space-4);
    background-color: var(--color-accent-primary);
    color: var(--color-bg-canvas);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold);
    padding: 2px 8px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .care-plan-card h3 {
    font-size: var(--font-size-xl);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .care-price {
    font-family: var(--font-family-mono);
    font-size: var(--font-size-2xl);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold);
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .care-target {
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
    min-height: 36px;
  }

  .care-features {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  .care-features li::before {
    content: "✓ ";
    color: var(--color-accent-primary);
  }

  .services-cta {
    margin-top: var(--space-20);
    padding: var(--space-12);
    background-color: var(--color-bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-hairline);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    text-align: center;
    max-width: 700px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  .services-cta h2 {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .services-cta p {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .service-details-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }

    .care-plans-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>
